  "releaseNotes": "**DI021/DI022 symbol-bound concurrency knobs** — strengthen-only fallback scans now accept a constant concurrency value only when the assignment binds to the expected SDK option property for Service Bus, RabbitMQ, `ParallelOptions`, or TPL Dataflow. Unrelated user properties with names such as `MaxConcurrentCalls` or `ConsumerDispatchConcurrency` no longer upgrade a config-gated DI022 Info diagnostic into a false DI021 Warning.",
